# Groups every new desktop user gets, however the account is made:
# the installer's first user, adduser, and System Settings' Users page.
# One group per line. Run sparky-stereo-user-groups apply after editing.
# Groups that equal root or read every keystroke (docker, disk, input, shadow,
# sudo and a few more) are refused.
#
# games       wheel and pedal tuning knobs of sim rigs (hid-fanatecff and friends), game score files
# dialout     serial boards: Arduino, ESP32, USB serial adapters
# plugdev     removable devices and cameras (gphoto2, usbmuxd)
# audio       real-time audio devices (cpu_dma_latency, rtc0, hpet, see 99-sparky-audio.rules)
# video       cameras, capture cards, TV tuners, framebuffers
# bluetooth   the Bluetooth service on D-Bus
# netdev      Wi-Fi and network settings without a password (NetworkManager rule)
# lpadmin     add and change printers in CUPS
# scanner     scanners (SANE)
# kvm         /dev/kvm, for virtual machines
# render      GPU compute and render nodes (ROCm, OpenCL, Vulkan without a seat)
# sambashare  share a folder from Dolphin
games
dialout
plugdev
audio
video
bluetooth
netdev
lpadmin
scanner
kvm
render
sambashare
